"Free calculator that computes CPM, projected spend at target CPM, and required CPM to stay within budget."
msgstr ""
"Calculadora gratuita que calcula el CPM, el gasto proyectado con el CPM objetivo y el CPM requerido para mantenerse dentro del presupuesto."

#. meta twitter:description
#: tools/cpm-calculator.html
msgid ""
"Free cost-per-mille calculator for campaign planning and paid media diagnostics."
